#### 0.3.1 Design System Foundation

Before touching individual screens, establish a consistent base.

**Tasks:**
- Audit all Tailwind utility usage and consolidate into consistent spacing scale — pick 4/8/12/16/24/32/48 and stick to it
- Define typography scale: display, heading, subheading, body, caption, label — apply consistently everywhere
- Define a color token set using CSS variables or Tailwind config: primary, secondary, muted, destructive, success, warning, surface, border
- Standardize border radius across all components — pick one scale and apply it (cards, inputs, buttons, badges all consistent)
- Define elevation/shadow scale: flat, low, medium, high — cards use low, modals use medium, dropdowns use high
- All interactive elements must have defined hover, focus, active, and disabled states
- Create a spacing audit document listing every screen and its problem areas before fixing

