#### 0.3.2 Navbar

**Problems:** Alignment inconsistent, spacing off, doesn't feel premium.

**Tasks:**
- Fix vertical alignment of all navbar items — logo, links, user avatar, notification bell
- Add consistent left/right padding that respects the max-width container
- Active link indicator must be visually distinct — underline, pill background, or colored dot
