#### 0.3.3 Layout and Spacing

**Problems:** Too much empty space, desktop wastes horizontal space, stretched layouts.

**Tasks:**
- Set a consistent max-width container (1280px or 1440px) with auto horizontal margins
- All page layouts must use this container — nothing bleeds edge-to-edge except hero sections and maps
- Implement a proper sidebar + content layout for dashboard pages instead of full-width single column
- Use a 12-column grid system for dashboard panels — stats take 3 cols each, charts take 6-8 cols
- Section spacing must be consistent — use the spacing scale, not arbitrary padding
- Remove all instances of unnecessarily tall empty sections
- On mobile, stack columns properly — no horizontal overflow, no tiny unreadable text

