#### 0.3.4 Cards and Stats

**Problems:** Flat, basic, no visual depth.

**Tasks:**
- Redesign stat cards with icon, number, label, and trend indicator (up/down arrow with percentage)
- Add subtle gradient or colored left border on stat cards to differentiate categories
