### 5.1 Immutable Audit Trail

**Tasks:**
- Create a separate AuditLog MongoDB collection — append-only (no updates or deletes in application code)
- Every status change, assignment, broadcast, escalation, and moderation action writes an audit log entry: actor, action, target entity, timestamp, previous value, new value
